  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 1.1,
      "end": 3.84,
      "en": "Hello English learners, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "您好英语学习者，欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.12,
      "end": 4.66,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.12,
      "end": 6.12,
      "en": "And I'm Erika.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erika。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 6.4,
      "end": 11.16,
      "en": "And we're going to be looking at our fifth episode of our famous love story.",
      "zh": "我们将看看我们著名的爱情故事的第五集。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 11.52,
      "end": 13.26,
      "en": "Yes, I'm sorry I love you.",
      "zh": "是的，对不起，我爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 14.36,
      "end": 15.36,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 15.36,
      "end": 16.68,
      "en": "Part five.",
      "zh": "第五部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 17.36,
      "end": 21.48,
      "en": "So if you haven't listened to the first four, I suggest you go do that first because...",
      "zh": "所以如果你还没有听过前四个，我建议你先去做，因为..."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 21.96,
      "end": 22.78,
      "en": "You're going to be a little bit lost.",
      "zh": "你会有点失落。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 23.16,
      "end": 24.24,
      "en": "But it's getting really good.",
      "zh": "但它变得非常好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 24.64,
      "end": 27.8,
      "en": "Yeah, and so, so good that I don't think we can even say...",
      "zh": "是的，所以，太好了，我认为我们甚至不能说..."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 28.64,
      "end": 29.64,
      "en": "What's going to happen next.",
      "zh": "接下来会发生什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 29.64,
      "end": 31.14,
      "en": "We can't say what the key language is.",
      "zh": "我们不能说关键语言是什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 31.9,
      "end": 35.5,
      "en": "Yeah, we can't preview anything because we want to surprise you.",
      "zh": "是的，我们不能预览任何东西，因为我们想给你一个惊喜。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 36.12,
      "end": 37.12,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 37.12,
      "end": 37.62,
      "en": "But we can tell you this.",
      "zh": "但我们可以告诉你这一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 38.12,
      "end": 38.58,
      "en": "What's going on?",
      "zh": "怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 39.12,
      "end": 42.58,
      "en": "The last time we saw Veronica and Steven, they broke up, right?",
      "zh": "我们最后一次见到维罗妮卡和史蒂文时，他们分手了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 43.16,
      "end": 44.16,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 44.16,
      "end": 47.2,
      "en": "And Veronica was with her friend and feeling really terrible.",
      "zh": "维罗妮卡和她的朋友在一起，感觉真的很糟糕。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 47.2,
      "end": 50.3,
      "en": "And then Steven suddenly came to sing a beautiful song.",
      "zh": "然后史蒂文突然来唱一首优美的歌。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 50.84,
      "end": 52.12,
      "en": "So this is continuing on that.",
      "zh": "因此，这正在继续。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 52.76,
      "end": 53.76,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 53.76,
      "end": 54.76,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 54.76,
      "end": 62.12,
      "en": "So let's listen to the dialogue and then we'll come back and talk about some of the difficult vocabulary we might find.",
      "zh": "所以让我们听听对话，然后我们会回来讨论一些我们可能会发现的困难词汇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 71.44,
      "end": 73.76,
      "en": "Honey, of course I forgive you.",
      "zh": "亲爱的，我当然原谅你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 74.08,
      "end": 75.18,
      "en": "I love you so much.",
      "zh": "我非常爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 75.72,
      "end": 76.96,
      "en": "I've really missed you.",
      "zh": "我真的很想你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 77.42,
      "end": 79.5,
      "en": "I was wrong to get upset over nothing.",
      "zh": "我不该为那点小事生气。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 80.22,
      "end": 81.9,
      "en": "I'm sorry I haven't called or anything.",
      "zh": "对不起，我一直没给你打电话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 81.9,
      "end": 87.32,
      "en": "But right after you decided you wanted a break, I was up north to put out some major forest fires.",
      "zh": "可你刚说想暂时分开，我就去了北方扑救几场大型森林火灾。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 88.04,
      "end": 91.36,
      "en": "I was in the middle of nowhere working day and night trying to prevent the blaze from spreading.",
      "zh": "我在偏远地区日夜不停地工作，防止火势蔓延。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 91.8,
      "end": 92.54,
      "en": "It was pretty intense.",
      "zh": "情况相当危急。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 92.96,
      "end": 94.98,
      "en": "Oh, honey, I'm glad you're okay.",
      "zh": "哦，亲爱的，我很高兴你没事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 94.98,
      "end": 97.1,
      "en": "But I have some exciting news.",
      "zh": "但我有一些令人兴奋的消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 99.52,
      "end": 100.46,
      "en": "I think I'm pregnant.",
      "zh": "我想我怀孕了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 101.46,
      "end": 101.7,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 102.78,
      "end": 103.8,
      "en": "Wow, that's amazing.",
      "zh": "哇，太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 104.32,
      "end": 105.0,
      "en": "This is great news.",
      "zh": "这真是个好消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 105.8,
      "end": 107.02,
      "en": "I've always wanted to be a father.",
      "zh": "我一直想成为一个父亲。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 107.62,
      "end": 109.34,
      "en": "We'll go to the doctor first thing in the morning.",
      "zh": "明天一早我们就去看医生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 125.4,
      "end": 128.9,
      "en": "We have your test results back and indeed you are pregnant.",
      "zh": "化验结果出来了，你确实怀孕了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 129.42,
      "end": 130.28,
      "en": "Let's see here.",
      "zh": "让我看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 130.66,
      "end": 131.68,
      "en": "Everything seems to be in order.",
      "zh": "各项指标看起来都正常。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 132.28,
      "end": 139.7,
      "en": "Your approximate due date is October 27, 2009, so that means the baby was conceived on February 3, 2009.",
      "zh": "你的预产期大约是2009年10月27日，也就是说，孩子是在2009年2月3日左右受孕的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 142.68,
      "end": 143.11,
      "en": "Are you sure?",
      "zh": "你确定吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 143.76,
      "end": 144.99,
      "en": "Are these things accurate?",
      "zh": "这个日期准吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 145.77,
      "end": 146.95,
      "en": "Well, yes, sir, they are.",
      "zh": "准的，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 147.59,
      "end": 148.09,
      "en": "What's wrong?",
      "zh": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 148.92,
      "end": 150.7,
      "en": "Why are you asking me these questions?",
      "zh": "你为什么问我这些问题？"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 154.16,
      "end": 154.85,
      "en": "This baby isn't mine.",
      "zh": "这孩子不是我的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 155.6,
      "end": 158.35,
      "en": "I was away the first week of February at a training seminar.",
      "zh": "二月第一周我去参加培训了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 158.85,
      "end": 159.33,
      "en": "I...",
      "zh": "我……"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 159.72,
      "end": 160.72,
      "en": "I...",
      "zh": "我……"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 161.22,
      "end": 161.36,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 162.74,
      "end": 163.54,
      "en": "It can't be.",
      "zh": "不可能。"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 168.72,
      "end": 183.0,
      "en": "All right, so more drama in our love story.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们的爱情故事中还有更多的戏剧性。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 183.0,
      "end": 183.55,
      "en": "Oh, my God.",
      "zh": "哦，天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 184.05,
      "end": 186.43,
      "en": "Things were going well and now more bad news.",
      "zh": "事情进展顺利，现在更坏消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 186.89,
      "end": 187.65,
      "en": "Yeah, or good news.",
      "zh": "是的，还是好消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 188.01,
      "end": 188.43,
      "en": "Or good news.",
      "zh": "或好消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 188.95,
      "end": 189.45,
      "en": "We're not sure yet.",
      "zh": "我们还不确定。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 189.76,
      "end": 190.76,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 190.76,
      "end": 193.71,
      "en": "Okay, let's take a look at the vocabulary first in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们先来看看语言外卖中的词汇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 196.4,
      "end": 196.67,
      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
