      "end": 200.76,
      "en": "Well, we're going to look at four words now.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们现在要看四个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 200.76,
      "end": 202.29,
      "en": "The first one, blaze.",
      "zh": "第一个，大火。"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 203.09,
      "end": 203.49,
      "en": "Blaze.",
      "zh": "熊熊大火。"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 203.76,
      "end": 204.76,
      "en": "Blaze.",
      "zh": "熊熊大火。"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 204.76,
      "end": 205.76,
      "en": "Blaze.",
      "zh": "熊熊大火。"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 205.85,
      "end": 209.6,
      "en": "So, this noun is another word for a fire, right?",
      "zh": "所以，这个名词是火的另一个词，对吧？"
