      "en": "The blaze.",
      "zh": "火焰。"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 213.04,
      "end": 215.56,
      "en": "So, basically, it's like the flame of the fire.",
      "zh": "所以，基本上，它就像火焰的火焰。"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 215.56,
