    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "start": 216.56,
      "end": 221.13,
      "en": "This one is a little bit difficult, so I think we can use some examples to show us how to use this word.",
      "zh": "这个有点难，所以我想我们可以用一些例子来向我们展示如何使用这个词。"
    },
