      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "start": 278.52,
      "end": 280.59,
      "en": "We all know that it's nine months later, approximately.",
      "zh": "我们都知道，大约是九个月后。"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "start": 280.88,
      "end": 282.01,
      "en": "Yes, due dates.",
      "zh": "是的，截止日期。"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "start": 282.71,
      "end": 285.43,
      "en": "So, the due date is the date of birth, basically.",
      "zh": "所以，截止日期基本上是出生日期。"
    },
