      "en": "Would be, okay.",
      "zh": "会的，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 289.84,
      "end": 290.84,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "start": 290.84,
      "end": 293.11,
      "en": "When you go to the doctor and say, when will my baby be born?",
      "zh": "当你去看医生说，我的宝宝什么时候出生？"
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "start": 293.45,
      "end": 297.19,
      "en": "He'll say, well, your due date is blah, blah, blah.",
