    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 366.0,
      "end": 367.52,
      "en": "This time we're going to slow it down, right?",
      "zh": "这次我们要慢慢来，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "start": 367.52,
      "end": 372.04,
      "en": "Yeah, in case you were so shocked by what happened that you couldn't follow.",
      "zh": "是的，万一你对发生的事情感到震惊，以至于你无法跟上。"
    },
