      "en": "Honey, of course I forgive you.",
      "zh": "亲爱的，我当然原谅你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "start": 381.87,
      "end": 383.69,
      "en": "I love you so much.",
      "zh": "我非常爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "start": 384.35,
      "end": 386.13,
      "en": "I've really missed you.",
      "zh": "我真的很想你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "start": 386.81,
      "end": 388.13,
      "en": "Please forgive me.",
      "zh": "请原谅我。"
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "start": 388.53,
      "end": 391.21,
      "en": "I was wrong to get upset over nothing.",
      "zh": "我不该为那点小事生气。"
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "start": 392.27,
      "end": 402.43,
      "en": "I'm sorry I haven't called or anything, but right after you decided you wanted a break, I was called up north to put out some major forest fires.",
      "zh": "很抱歉我没有打电话或其他任何事情，但在你决定要休息后，我被叫到北方扑灭一些重大的森林火灾。"
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "start": 403.09,
      "end": 409.05,
      "en": "I was in the middle of nowhere, working day and night, trying to prevent the blaze from spreading.",
      "zh": "我在偏僻的地方，日夜工作，试图防止大火蔓延。"
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "start": 409.85,
      "end": 411.09,
      "en": "It was pretty intense.",
      "zh": "情况相当危急。"
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "start": 411.85,
      "end": 412.41,
      "en": "Oh, honey.",
      "zh": "哦，亲爱的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "start": 413.09,
      "end": 418.41,
      "en": "I'm glad you're okay, but I have some exciting news.",
      "zh": "我很高兴你没事，但我有一些令人兴奋的消息。"
    },
    {
