      "en": "I think I'm pregnant.",
      "zh": "我想我怀孕了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 147,
      "start": 422.19,
      "end": 422.87,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 148,
      "start": 423.47,
      "end": 425.41,
      "en": "Wow, that's amazing!",
      "zh": "哇，太神奇了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 149,
      "start": 426.67,
      "end": 427.65,
      "en": "This is great news!",
      "zh": "这是个好消息！"
    },
    {
      "id": 150,
      "start": 428.69,
      "end": 430.33,
      "en": "I've always wanted to be a father.",
      "zh": "我一直想成为一个父亲。"
    },
