      "end": 633.8,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 225,
      "start": 634.88,
      "end": 635.88,
      "en": "Everything is normal.",
      "zh": "一切都很正常。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 635.88,
      "end": 642.88,
      "en": "All right, so let's listen to this dramatic dialogue one more time and we'll come back and talk some more.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们再听一次这个戏剧性的对话，我们会回来再谈谈。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 651.37,
      "end": 653.77,
      "en": "Honey, of course I forgive you.",
      "zh": "亲爱的，我当然原谅你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 654.09,
      "end": 655.17,
      "en": "I love you so much.",
      "zh": "我非常爱你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 655.75,
      "end": 656.95,
      "en": "I've really missed you.",
      "zh": "我真的很想你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 657.41,
      "end": 659.51,
      "en": "I was wrong to get upset over nothing.",
      "zh": "我不该为那点小事生气。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 660.17,
      "end": 661.91,
      "en": "I'm sorry I haven't called or anything.",
      "zh": "对不起，我一直没给你打电话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 661.91,
      "end": 667.33,
      "en": "But right after you decided you wanted a break, I was up north to put out some major forest fires.",
      "zh": "可你刚说想暂时分开，我就去了北方扑救几场大型森林火灾。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 667.97,
      "end": 671.39,
      "en": "I was in the middle of nowhere working day and night trying to prevent the blaze from spreading.",
      "zh": "我在偏远地区日夜不停地工作，防止火势蔓延。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 671.81,
      "end": 672.53,
      "en": "It was pretty intense.",
      "zh": "情况相当危急。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 672.99,
      "end": 677.09,
      "en": "Oh, honey, I'm glad you're okay, but I have some exciting news.",
      "zh": "哦，亲爱的，我很高兴你没事，但我有一些令人兴奋的消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 679.54,
      "end": 680.46,
      "en": "I think I'm pregnant.",
      "zh": "我想我怀孕了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 681.46,
      "end": 681.74,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 682.81,
      "end": 683.81,
      "en": "Wow, that's amazing.",
      "zh": "哇，太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 684.35,
      "end": 685.01,
      "en": "This is great news.",
      "zh": "这真是个好消息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 685.85,
      "end": 687.05,
      "en": "I've always wanted to be a father.",
      "zh": "我一直想成为一个父亲。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 687.96,
      "end": 705.76,
      "en": "You'll go to the doctor first thing in the morning.",
      "zh": "你早上第一件事就是去看医生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 705.76,
      "end": 708.9,
      "en": "We have your test results back and indeed, you are pregnant.",
      "zh": "我们有您的测试结果，确实，您怀孕了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 709.88,
      "end": 710.3,
      "en": "Let's see here.",
      "zh": "让我看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 710.92,
      "end": 711.7,
      "en": "Everything seems to be in order.",
      "zh": "各项指标看起来都正常。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 712.32,
      "end": 722.72,
      "en": "Our approximate due date is October 27, 2009, so that means the baby was conceived on February 3, 2009.",
      "zh": "我们的大致截止日期是 2009 年 10 月 27 日，这意味着婴儿是在 2009 年 2 月 3 日受孕的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 722.72,
      "end": 723.11,
      "en": "Are you sure?",
      "zh": "你确定吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 723.8,
      "end": 725.01,
      "en": "Are these things accurate?",
      "zh": "这个日期准吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 725.81,
      "end": 726.95,
      "en": "Well, yes, sir, they are.",
      "zh": "准的，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 727.65,
      "end": 728.11,
      "en": "What's wrong?",
      "zh": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 728.84,
      "end": 730.7,
      "en": "Why are you asking me these questions?",
      "zh": "你为什么问我这些问题？"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 733.66,
      "end": 734.82,
      "en": "This baby isn't mine.",
      "zh": "这孩子不是我的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 735.48,
      "end": 738.38,
      "en": "I was away the first week of February at a training seminar.",
      "zh": "二月第一周我去参加培训了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 738.78,
      "end": 739.38,
      "en": "I...",
      "zh": "我……"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 739.44,
      "end": 740.76,
      "en": "I...",
      "zh": "我……"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 741.19,
      "end": 741.35,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 741.76,
      "end": 742.76,
      "en": "It can't be.",
      "zh": "不可能。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 742.78,
      "end": 743.54,
      "en": "It can't be.",
      "zh": "不可能。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 755.41,
      "end": 757.99,
      "en": "Well, Marco, what do you think about this situation?",
      "zh": "好吧，马可，你对这种情况有什么看法？"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 758.87,
      "end": 760.55,
      "en": "What would you do if you were this guy?",
      "zh": "如果你是这个人，你会怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 760.85,
      "end": 761.31,
      "en": "It's complicated.",
      "zh": "它很复杂。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 762.57,
      "end": 762.96,
      "en": "I know.",
      "zh": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 762.96,
      "end": 764.62,
      "en": "Uh, I don't know what I would do.",
      "zh": "呃，我不知道我会做什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 764.62,
      "end": 768.09,
      "en": "It seems like something very typical of soap operas.",
      "zh": "这似乎是非常典型的肥皂剧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 768.19,
      "end": 768.35,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 769.27,
      "end": 773.09,
      "en": "Well, I don't know because she didn't really deny it in the end.",
      "zh": "好吧，我不知道，因为她最终并没有真正否认。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 773.27,
      "end": 775.19,
      "en": "She didn't say no right away.",
      "zh": "她没有马上说不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 775.47,
      "end": 777.23,
      "en": "Yeah, but she didn't say like, oh.",
      "zh": "是的，但她没有说，哦。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 777.91,
      "end": 784.99,
      "en": "Yeah, she didn't really accept it, so it's still a little bit difficult to see if maybe she cheated on him or something.",
      "zh": "是的，她并没有真正接受它，所以很难看出她是否欺骗了他或其他什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 785.44,
      "end": 786.57,
      "en": "Hey, guys, what do you think?",
      "zh": "嘿，伙计们，你怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 787.44,
      "end": 788.99,
      "en": "Do you think Veronica cheated on Stephen?",
      "zh": "你认为维罗妮卡欺骗了斯蒂芬吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 789.52,
      "end": 790.21,
      "en": "Do you think it's his baby?",
      "zh": "你以为是他的孩子吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 790.88,
      "end": 791.17,
      "en": "Maybe it's not.",
      "zh": "也许不是。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 791.88,
      "end": 792.35,
      "en": "Maybe the doctor is wrong.",
      "zh": "也许医生是错的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 792.88,
      "end": 793.69,
      "en": "Maybe it's the doctor's baby.",
      "zh": "也许是医生的宝贝。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 794.08,
      "end": 795.88,
      "en": "Maybe it's...",
      "zh": "也许是..."
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 795.88,
      "end": 801.4,
      "en": "Anything could happen here at EnglishPod, so send us your ideas and tell us what do you think happens next.",
      "zh": "EnglishPod 可能发生任何事情，因此请将您的想法发送给我们，并告诉我们您认为接下来会发生什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 801.4,
      "end": 804.79,
      "en": "Come to EnglishPod.com where you can leave your questions, your comments.",
      "zh": "访问 Englishpod.com，您可以在其中留下您的问题，您的评论。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 805.43,
      "end": 810.57,
      "en": "Yeah, and Marco and I are always around to answer your questions, respond to your comments.",
      "zh": "是的，马可和我总是在回答你的问题，回复你的评论。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 811.07,
      "end": 814.25,
      "en": "Exactly, and we want to know what you think will happen next.",
      "zh": "没错，我们想知道你认为接下来会发生什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 814.68,
      "end": 815.68,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 815.68,
      "end": 817.24,
      "en": "All right, guys, so until next time.",
      "zh": "好吧，伙计们，直到下一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 817.49,
      "end": 817.63,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 818.24,
      "end": 826.567,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
